# Testing

- Agents: run `pnpm test` (and `pnpm eval:report-quality` when changing schema, calibration, or pipeline) after changes — see `agent-execution`.
- Use **synthetic** company names and phones only — no real PII in fixtures.
- When changing `report-schema` or search validation, update tests in the same change.
- MVP scope: `src/lib` unit tests; E2E is V2+ per `docs/phases/V2-roadmap.md`.
- Do not add tests that only assert mocks or framework defaults.
